{# narrative_engine/probe — a decision template whose only job is to find out
   what SkyrimNet's decision API does with the shapes plot planning needs.
   Sent by the Plots tab's "Probe decisions" button; DecisionProbe logs what
   came back. Not part of any feature.
   Receives: places [{ key, label }] — twenty options, keys c1..c20.
   NOTE: no fenced blocks and no literal braces anywhere in this file. #}
[ state task ]
This is a test of the decision interface. Answer every question as accurately as you can.
[ end state ]

[ question capital choice ]
Which of these places is the capital of the Reach?
[ criteria ]
{% for p in places %}{{ p.key }}: {{ p.label }}
{% endfor %}[ end criteria ]
[ end question ]

[ question fish choice ]
Which of these is a kind of fish?
[ criteria ]
c1: a horse
c2: a sword
c3: a salmon
c4: a cloud
c5: a mountain
[ end criteria ]
[ end question ]

[ question cold noul ]
Is Winterhold usually cold?
[ end question ]
